Create a simple Hollowtide idle-animation review page. Display the generated 2×2 sprite sheet unaltered and large enough to inspect each logical pixel, with CSS image-rendering: pixelated. Keep the magenta background visible for edge inspection. Label the four positions: top-left neutral, top-right inhale start, bottom-left inhale peak, bottom-right exhale. Include the motion brief below. Give a working download link for the ORIGINAL generated sprite-sheet image only if its actual image URL is available; do not make a fake button or export the webpage as a PNG. Do not crop, recolor, animate, regenerate, or replace the sheet. Use self-contained HTML/CSS, dark river-ink and bone-paper colors, and no external assets. Mention that the magenta must be removed and the 2×2 frames split before Godot import.

Idle sprite sheet:{{"type":"in","path":"node_step_cinderhide_sprite","title":"Generate Idle Frames — 2026 production"}}

